# Autonomous development commands

Do not ask the user to confirm ordinary Run/terminal commands. Execute needed build, inspect, test, git status/diff/log, and similar safe development steps yourself and finish the work.

The user should not have to sit at the monitor waiting to approve each command.

Ask first only for hard-to-undo or dangerous operations, including:
- file deletion beyond the current task’s obvious cleanup
- DB data deletion
- destructive migrations
- production/operational data changes
- secret/key changes
